msgstr "復元は適用されず、何も失われていません"

#. src: angelo_agent/checkpoint_review_ui.py
msgid "Restored the document to the protected state before the previous restore and reverted {count} file changes. Chat history was kept. Nothing replaces your saved file until you save and confirm it."
